                "3 mL nitric acid (68%) was added gradually to bismuth nitrate solution during stirring until completely dissolved.",
                "Two solutions were mixed and 0.02 mol triammonium citrate was added as complexing agent and stirred for 30 minutes.",
                "Gel was obtained by continuous stirring at 90\u00b0C until water completely evaporated.",
                "Gel was calcined at 550\u00b0C for 2 hours to obtain pure phase BFO powder particles.",
                "10 mL of 0.3 M cadmium chloride solution was added to 50 mL of 0.1 M sodium citrate solution and stirred at room temperature for 20 minutes.",
                "3 mL concentrated ammonia (NH3\u00b7H2O 28%) and 10 mL of 0.6 M thiourea solution were added in sequence.",
                "Mixed solution was reacted in water bath at 60\u00b0C for 2.5 hours.",
                "Precipitate was collected by centrifugation, rinsed with deionized water and anhydrous ethanol, and dried at 60\u00b0C."
            ],
